Extend the existing Curriculum Server Super Admin Control Plane.

Create a dedicated administrative module:

AI Textbook Generation Governance

The module must allow the Super Admin to configure and manage textbook generation independently by:

- Education level.
- Class or grade.
- Subject.
- Curriculum version.
- Academic session, where applicable.

The interface must support a matrix-based configuration.

Example:

Educational level| Class| Subject| Generation policy
