The actual subjects, classes and educational levels must be dynamically retrieved from the central curriculum database.

Do not assume that every education framework uses identical class names or structures.

1.2 Super Admin controls

For every subject-class combination, provide the ability to:

1. Enable textbook generation.
2. Disable textbook generation.
3. Create generation rules.
4. Edit existing generation rules.
5. Set academic depth.
6. Set content complexity.
