SUCCESS CRITERION:

Curriculum Server must become a centrally governed, NERDC-grounded textbook generation platform in which the Super Admin can independently control Gemini's academic behaviour for every subject and class through the Control Plane.

Every generated textbook must be appropriate to its assigned class, comprehensive in its curriculum coverage, academically accurate, pedagogically coherent, and consistent between graphical illustrations and verbal explanations.

The system must enforce these requirements at the backend and database levels, not merely recommend them to Gemini.